未来中行走的</text><text for="line-17b49b6b-17fa-4253-a26f-94bd0f29d902">孩子的眼眸里看到的</text><text for="line-816fada1-535b-42fe-8788-1b9ae74ccd57">渺茫的希望</text><text for="line-c563bffd-65ff-49b6-af86-06bf390aabd1">仿佛是折磨着我们的罪孽</text><text for="line-0b6789c1-74f9-4ba2-b2dc-e4012f1df346">这片天空所遗失的故事</text><text for="line-52f0a4a4-5a28-436f-bddd-9f220e655ecd">本应曾在某时见过的</text><text for="line-77900a18-5602-4014-a57f-7c2be6f2d57d">一直寻求着的光辉</text><text for="line-6ae79b14-ad27-435c-9ef4-1bff2999dbf3">踏步在唯有心灵干渴的世界上</text><text for="line-01753a2a-8523-411f-928c-1879f5ddbf9d">只是又活过了一天</text><text for="line-d7bb40c8-a5f4-4c82-ab12-ecc5104fc832">沐浴着锈蚀的风</text><text for="line-586ef6f9-db5f-478e-8eae-f07f6040ba26">我们连踏上漫无目的的</text><text for="line-e636ec2e-d6e9-41f8-ad4d-f5fe94aa30f2">旅途都做不到</text><text for="line-5c7f0ced-1a77-4102-bdda-d47124429329">明天比起昨天</text><text for="line-ae067c9e-9554-43c7-b68e-abde88189021">破碎世界的模样</text><text for="e3b1837a-6e65-459d-9c09-ef4bae96142b"><span ttm:role="x-bg" for="line-91b0c72a-8fee-41e5-9f8b-a0fb5ff39756">((对你))</span></text><text for="line-b60e038a-120b-4e93-ad5a-42425d9ccfba">前往那片天空的彼方</text><text for="line-4c841f3d-dd73-4d3b-89ae-89dccc81ee05">如果能够做到的话</text><text for="line-e01e201e-f553-4345-b139-602e093d50a6">想知道是否就能夺回曾经</text><text for="line-7b9728ea-6e4a-4f3a-a584-262fafa5effe">寻求着昔日路标的手心</text><text for="line-ee4de50d-2727-48cb-a872-144d90387ae8">曾紧握着微小的光芒</text><text for="line-c7c3cfac-5617-42d4-a11a-0e569f8d0022">传承着的记忆</text><text for="line-fdebba7d-1c1a-497e-80a6-b317e3af08f5">漫长的旅途中</text><text for="line-89245893-f9a7-4ae4-9307-421b94e8bdf3">苍穹的边界</text><text for="line-6937b24f-fc5c-43cc-9164-284a10f1ef9b">星辰之声</text><text for="line-be45739f-4a16-4cba-b7ab-1aca097466ce">终有一天会传达出去</text><text for="line-6ad7300c-433a-4dcf-8f0d-cf9f4d2c6d38">这片天空所遗失的故事</text><text for="line-0d00b090-63a0-4ca1-b220-d74f8d1d1e5c">本应曾在某时见过的</text><text for="line-9ac2c8e8-522c-4fbc-afad-0465d9780242">一直寻求着的光辉</text><text for="line-95a60b3c-f0ca-40fc-a0ff-fa99440fc2ec">寻求着昔日路标的手心</text><text for="line-a8763d4a-6b9a-4c0d-963b-8cea125d78cf">曾紧握着微小的光芒</text><text for="line-98ac62ef-51de-42fc-beec-75ceeb5a418b">这片天空所遗失的故事</text><text for="line-2426c576-1e25-4bc1-b8d8-1c5f96352b37">本应曾在某时见过的</text><text for="line-8207b2de-9c8e-4ad7-a832-979371af49ce">一直寻求着的温柔</text><text for="line-4a464d4c-e848-4fe4-98af-471a4f4e1115">那澄澈的蓝色世界的碎片哟</text><text for="line-36dc262c-7e9c-44c7-9d89-7fe1cc80e560">传达到你的身边吧</text><text for="80cc489f-8993-428b-ab4b-1150a68edc9b">如铅一般沉重</text><text for="fd57a08c-437b-4342-9bf4-7ffd9541e50e">连呼吸也隐匿起来</text><text for="eb8403e9-7bf9-4d78-bf3a-e59e661592ea">更加褪色</text><text for="e3b1837a-6e65-459d-9c09-ef4bae96142b">是谁曾期望的</text><text for="aeab9913-85af-482a-b7ea-643c2985b580">传述着的话语</text><text for="c4601155-72a6-46d9-9a62-3f6a80b77faf">怀抱着小小的心灵</text><text for="230d58a9-d47a-44f2-ac68-c83241e48765">向着大气的尽头</text><text for="line-6937b24f-fc5c-43cc-9164-284a10f1ef9b"><span ttm:role="x-bg" for="378291b7-7e34-498d-9d24-db6aeec8be5d">(曾梦见的)</span></text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="03:58.949"><div><p xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xml:id="line-275217e3-57de-4a32-b52f-20d697fd0e33" itunes:key="line-275217e3-57de-4a32-b52f-20d697fd0e33" begin="00:00.716" end="00:04.196" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="00:00.716" end="00:00.896">こ</span><span begin="00:00.896" end="00:01.036">の</span><span begin="00:01.036" end="00:01.376" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">空</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:01.036" end="00:01.236">そ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:01.236" end="00:01.376">ら</span></span></span><span begin="00:01.376" end="00:01.696">が</span><span begin="00:01.696" end="00:01.896">な</span><span begin="00:01.896" end="00:02.056">く</span><span begin="00:02.056" end="00:02.556">し</span><span begin="00:02.556" end="00:02.746">た</span><span begin="00:02.746" end="00:03.396" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">物</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:02.746" end="00:03.096">も</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:03.096" end="00:03.396">の</span></span></span><span begin="00:03.396" end="00:04.196" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">語</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:03.396" end="00:03.736">が</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:03.736" end="00:03.936">た</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:03.936" end="00:04.196">り</span></span></span></p><p xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xml:id="line-84622433-862f-4e0e-b2b1-01dad571c893" itunes:key="line-84622433-862f-4e0e-b2b1-01dad571c893" begin="00:04.586" end="00:06.836" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="00:04.586" end="00:04.756">い</span><span begin="00:04.756" end="00:05.096">つ</span><span begin="00:05.096" end="00:05.408">か</span><span begin="00:05.408" end="00:05.736" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">見</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:05.408" end="00:05.736">み</span></span></span><span begin="00:05.736" end="00:06.042">た</span><span begin="00:06.042" end="00:06.396">は</span><span begin="00:06.396" end="00:06.536">ず</span><span begin="00:06.536" end="00:06.836">の</span></p><p xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xml:id="line-1fdad6a7-1ab7-4124-8921-ca73a9fc986a" itunes:key="line-1fdad6a7-1ab7-4124-8921-ca73a9fc986a" begin="00:07.272" end="00:13.000" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="00:07.272" end="00:08.112" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">輝</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:07.272" end="00:07.492">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:07.492" end="00:07.812">が</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:07.812" end="00:08.112">や</span></span></span><span begin="00:08.112" end="00:08.432">き</span><span begin="00:08.432" end="00:08.712">を</span><span begin="00:08.732" end="00:09.312" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base